/* Pf014: helix on CYLINDRICAL_SURFACE exported as huge B-spline pcurve instead of analytic 2D LINE; thousands of poles/knots; the defect entity is emitted but sits unreachable from the shape-rep root (product chain roots a GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET stub), so OCC loads only a 1-vertex stub (shape(1)); byte-present but oracle-invisible to the load-time shape-count oracles */
